{"id":"4e3b467d5761af40","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-cantor-space.md","title":"Cantor Space","display":"df-cantor-space — Cantor Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cantor-space","aliases":["58-df-cantor-space","58-df-zfc-metric-cantor-space"],"display":"df-cantor-space — Cantor Space","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cantor-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cantor-space</span><span>58-df-zfc-metric-cantor-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cantor-space — Cantor Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> (自然数集，标准符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> (二元集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，标准符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (有限二进制序列集合，标准符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (变元，表示函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> (变元，表示有限二进制序列)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x, y\">\\(x, y\\)</span> (变元，表示 Cantor 空间中的点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (basic cylinder sets, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (product topology, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(d_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (standard ultrametric, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (Cantor-space presentation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathcal C\\coloneqq2^\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathcal C\\coloneqq2^\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash [\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal C:\\sigma\\subseteq f\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash [\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal C:\\sigma\\subseteq f\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathcal B_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathcal B_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\tau_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathcal C:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(x\\in[\\sigma]\\land[\\sigma]\\subseteq U)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\tau_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathcal C:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(x\\in[\\sigma]\\land[\\sigma]\\subseteq U)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash d_{\\mathcal C}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n0 &amp; x = y \\\\\n2^{-\\min\\{n \\in \\omega : x(n) \\neq y(n)\\}} &amp; x \\neq y\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash d_{\\mathcal C}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n0 &amp; x = y \\\\\n2^{-\\min\\{n \\in \\omega : x(n) \\neq y(n)\\}} &amp; x \\neq y\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C},d_{\\mathcal C})\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal C=2^\\omega\\land\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal C}=\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\land\\tau_{\\mathcal C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathcal C:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(x\\in[\\sigma]\\land[\\sigma]\\subseteq U)\\}\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\left(d_{\\mathcal C}(x,y)=\\begin{cases}0&amp;x=y,\\\\2^{-\\min\\{n\\in\\omega:x(n)\\neq y(n)\\}}&amp;x\\neq y.\\end{cases}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C},d_{\\mathcal C})\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal C=2^\\omega\\land\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal C}=\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\land\\tau_{\\mathcal C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathcal C:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(x\\in[\\sigma]\\land[\\sigma]\\subseteq U)\\}\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\left(d_{\\mathcal C}(x,y)=\\begin{cases}0&amp;x=y,\\\\2^{-\\min\\{n\\in\\omega:x(n)\\neq y(n)\\}}&amp;x\\neq y.\\end{cases}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cantor 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{C} = 2^{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal{C} = 2^{\\omega}\\)</span> 是紧致完美全不连通的 Polish 空间</li>\n<li>它同胚于三进 Cantor 集</li>\n<li>Cantor 空间是标准的零维紧致度量空间</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{C}\">\\(\\mathcal{C}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{N} = \\omega^{\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal{N} = \\omega^{\\omega}\\)</span> 通过连续映射相互转换</li>\n<li>递归枚举 Borel 层级在 Cantor 空间中具有规范表示</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x, y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathcal C\\coloneqq2^\\omega","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash [\\sigma]\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal C:\\sigma\\subseteq f\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathcal B_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\tau_{\\mathcal C}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathcal C:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;(x\\in[\\sigma]\\land[\\sigma]\\subseteq U)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash d_{\\mathcal C}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n0 & x = y \\\\\n2^{-\\min\\{n \\in \\omega : x(n) \\neq y(n)\\}} & x \\neq y\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cantor\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricCantorSpace}_S(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C},d_{\\mathcal C})\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal C=2^\\omega\\land\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal C}=\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\}\\land\\tau_{\\mathcal C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathcal C:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;(x\\in[\\sigma]\\land[\\sigma]\\subseteq U)\\}\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\left(d_{\\mathcal C}(x,y)=\\begin{cases}0&x=y,\\\\2^{-\\min\\{n\\in\\omega:x(n)\\neq y(n)\\}}&x\\neq y.\\end{cases}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{C} = 2^{\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{N} = \\omega^{\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":2406,"backlinks":[{"id":"fbbe1e58786a3b0b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B(\\mathcal C,\\tau_{\\mathcal C})$ and $[\\sigma]$ (Cantor-space Borel structure and cylinders, see [[